---
// N1: Both WebKit pseudo-elements and W3C scrollbar properties are specified
---
<div class="custom-scroll">
  <p>Fully compliant cross-engine scrollable list</p>
</div>

<style>
  .custom-scroll {
    scrollbar-width: thin;
    scrollbar-color: #94a3b8 #f1f5f9;
  }
  .custom-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar {
    width: 6px;
  }
  .custom-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
    background-color: #94a3b8;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }
</style>
